EASIEST WAY TO POPULATE THIS FILE CORRECTLY:
When you create/edit this repository on GitHub, use
"Add file -> Create new file" -> name it LICENSE -> GitHub will offer a
"Choose a license template" button. Select "Apache License 2.0" and GitHub
will insert the full, correct license text automatically with your name
and year filled in. Commit that in place of this placeholder before you
make the repository public.

